5. What is a Web Server?

A web server is a computer or software that receives requests from clients (browsers) and sends web resources such as HTML pages, CSS, JavaScript, and images.

Examples of Web Servers
Apache HTTP Server
Nginx
Microsoft IIS
LiteSpeed
Node.js HTTP Server

